# For Streamlit Community Cloud deployment:
# In your app's dashboard, go to Settings -> Secrets and paste:
#
#   GEMINI_API_KEY = "your-gemini-key-here"
#
# This file is just a local reference/example — Streamlit Cloud secrets
# are entered in the web dashboard, not read from this file. If you want
# a local secrets.toml instead of a .env file, copy this to
# .streamlit/secrets.toml (it's already gitignored).
